      "provenance": "Pleiades",
      "associationCertaintyURI": "https://pleiades.stoa.org/vocabularies/association-certainty/certain",
      "start": 1500,
      "details": "<p data-start=\"202\" data-end=\"323\">Another is the <em>N\u016bbe</em> (Nubia) realm, which N\u016bbe, son of <em>\u1e32ar\u1e6d\u012bn</em>, son of <em>Nab\u1e63ar</em>, son of <em>\u1e24\u0101m</em>, built and established.\u00a0The capital of this land is the city of <em>Dun\u1e33ula</em> (Dongola, Sudan), which was first settled and made prosperous by the people of <em>S\u016bd\u0101n</em> (the Cushitic / Nubian peoples).\u00a0Its inhabitants follow the <em>Na\u1e63\u0101r\u0101-y\u0131 Ya\u2018\u1e33\u016bbiyye</em> (Jacobite / Miaphysite Christian) religion and are counted among the people of unbelief and error. [translation]</p>",
